  "title": {
    "rendered": "سورة العلق مكتوبة بخط كبير: 19 آية مع الترجمة الإنجليزية"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">نقدم سورة العلق مكتوبة بخط كبير، وعدد آياتها 19، مع تلاوة صوتية آية بآية.</p>\n\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #EAEAEA; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0;\">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><script type=\"text/javascript\">\n  function changesoundy(ID) {\n    var sound_id = document.getElementById(\"quran_player_by_sora\");\n    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><audio controls autoplay><source src=\"'+ID+'\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">متصفحك لا يدعم عنصر الصوت</audio><br /><a href=\"'+ID+'\">تنزيل الملف</a></div>';\n  }\n</script><h2 class=\"sora_title\">سورة العلق</h2><div id=\"quran_player_by_sora\"></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096001.mp3');\">اقْرَأْ بِاسْمِ رَبِّكَ الَّذِي خَلَقَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [1]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096002.mp3');\">خَلَقَ الْإِنسَانَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [2]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096003.mp3');\">اقْرَأْ وَرَبُّكَ الْأَكْرَمُ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [3]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096004.mp3');\">الَّذِي عَلَّمَ بِالْقَلَمِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [4]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096005.mp3');\">عَلَّمَ الْإِنسَانَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [5]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096006.mp3');\">كَلَّا إِنَّ الْإِنسَانَ لَيَطْغَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [6]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096007.mp3');\">أَن رَّآهُ اسْتَغْنَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [7]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096008.mp3');\">إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ الرُّجْعَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [8]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096009.mp3');\">أَرَأَيْتَ الَّذِي يَنْهَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [9]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096010.mp3');\">عَبْدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [10]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096011.mp3');\">أَرَأَيْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى الْهُدَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [11]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096012.mp3');\">أَوْ أَمَرَ بِالتَّقْوَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [12]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096013.mp3');\">أَرَأَيْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [13]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096014.mp3');\">أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ اللَّهَ يَرَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [14]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096015.mp3');\">كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًا بِالنَّاصِيَةِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [15]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096016.mp3');\">نَاصِيَةٍ كَاذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [16]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096017.mp3');\">فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [17]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096018.mp3');\">سَنَدْعُ الزَّبَانِيَةَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [18]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/096019.mp3');\">كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَاسْجُدْ وَاقْتَرِب ۩ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">العلق [19]</span></div></div></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
